      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "You are not delaying the inevitable; you are simply waiting for the silence to finally arrive so you can finally breathe. The peace you seek is not found in stopping the noise, but in learning to live with the sound of your own heart beating without the need for external validation. You do not have to fight anymore, because your existence already exists regardless of whether you feel anything.",
